{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:095af0319477a17211c13c199df1bb7cf94bf008426b3c88d196c68b757f6dab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c129c11476133b64e4fe7fdd521e70eb87128b44b81141dd87003eccfcc7ce7f",
      "text": "呜哇～！果然这几件衣服全都超赞的！\n成熟男人的成熟品味，大爆发了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1130a9d02f817fff3f2175badfc5b31e033f3f1126b0ac14be19d00102ea7fa2",
      "text": "时尚又帅气啊！\n不过店看起来很贵，刚进去的时候紧张死了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43437c4fa5a09c2458dd697efdd6601caf8da4ca129a3bad6b45b567374a1bfe",
      "text": "我也是我也是！不过店员人很好呢。\n那就是所谓的奢华氛围吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bae2e93ccff4d92b657067079d51c84ac8a1330688aa9e949cfbe7111b173b8",
      "text": "而且，明明是服装店，却散发着超级好闻的香味！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fae86b5909fb4b47dd1a653e1df910fe77ddc2ec1407a79a2416f5495702717",
      "text": "在店里的时候，你居然在注意那些东西吗……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef9a0983412a513bf0aaa1204c346fd57bc7c292955ff577d4547be6049be107",
      "text": "呵呵。明明从早上开始就走了很多路……。\n大家，真有精神呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2877f65e66903c77dedfd0864827e9bef5f60f115a34d33453f4318ea9974aea",
      "text": "各位，今天谢谢你们\n陪我们一起买东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8a4b68cd3a6e56a73106ec81129d73dcf196ecb36faabc1886b49b1fb9901f9",
      "text": "多亏你们5个一起过来，帮大忙了。\n托大家的福，买到了适合特番的好服装呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e4b2c0a7d789e30828d4b3339997954396d840922117a9acc960402238e0f4",
      "text": "这样一来应该会受现在的年轻人欢迎，\n在制作部门也能拿到高评价了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2da58f0ed5cad87729a982b7780a958c6f956d41f4f0545b2644234711732ca",
      "text": "剩下的就看老爷爷看到这套服装之后，\n能不能提起干劲了啊……。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
